flowchart TB
    U["User or trusted policy<br/>Goal, constraints, budget and permissions"]
    S["Product Scout<br/>Evidence-backed opportunities and outcomes"]
    L["Engineer integration owner<br/>Technical plan, shared contracts and key implementation"]
    C["Verified controller - ordinary code<br/>Dependencies, claims, limits, recovery and backpressure"]
    E1["Engineer A<br/>One continuing workstream context"]
    E2["Engineer B<br/>Only when independent parallel work is useful"]
    W["Optional temporary subagent<br/>Auxiliary task, no recursive teams"]
    V["Verifier pool<br/>Independent workstream acceptance"]
    I["Integration owner<br/>Pinned combined candidate and project checks"]
    IV["Independent Verifier<br/>Integration Passed for all project ACs"]
    P["Project PR_READY<br/>Not merge or release permission"]
    O["Operator<br/>Authorized delivery and actual observation"]
    G["CI, protected branches and scoped executors<br/>External enforcement"]

    S -->|"Proposal, not authorization"| U
    U -->|"Goal and bounds"| L
    L -->|"Minimal plan; serial when coupled"| C
    C --> E1
    C --> E2
    E1 -.->|"Bounded assistance"| W
    W -.->|"Evidence and changes"| E1
    E1 -->|"Pinned stream and checks"| V
    E2 -->|"Pinned stream and checks"| V
    V -->|"Findings to original owner; budget applies"| C
    V -->|"INTEGRATION_READY"| I
    I --> IV
    IV -->|"Cross-stream repairs"| L
    IV -->|"Current PASS"| P
    P -->|"PR-only endpoint"| U
    P -->|"Delivery in scope"| O
    U -.->|"Action-specific grants"| O
    O -->|"Observed outcome"| S
    O -->|"Bounded incident repair"| L
    O -->|"Result or escalation"| U
    G -.->|"Actual check evidence"| V
    G -.->|"Combined checks"| IV
    G -.->|"Enforced actions"| O
